                "senderName": "NWS Juneau AK",
                "headline": "Special Weather Statement issued November 24 at 1:10PM AKST by NWS Juneau AK",
                "description": "Tidal levels across the panhandle are expected to be running high\nfor the next few days. These high tides combined with passing low\npressures and their associated fronts could create some\npotentially higher than normal water levels. Wind direction,\nmagnitude, and timing with these systems will be monitored closely as\na combination of high tide and winds in an onshore direction\ncould lead to tides exceeding astronomical high tide by a foot or\nmore.",
